  "_comment": "Real acquisitions for parity/real/run_real.sh. Each file comes from an installed R package (`r_package` + `path` under its library directory), a `url`, or is a `member` of the dataset's zip `archive` (`url` + `sha256`), and must match `sha256`. `chain` picks the comparison: `qc` (margins, compensation, logicle, PeacoQC; any `$SPILL` file), `autospill` (single-stain controls listed in `controls` as filename, dye = detector `$PnN`, antigen, wavelength; spillover matrix and gates vs R autospill), `autospectral` (spectral single-stain controls under `controls/` with AutoSpectral's `control_file.csv`, stained samples under `sample/`, `autospectral_cytometer` naming the get.autospectral.param cytometer; spectra and unmixed abundances vs R AutoSpectral) `flowsom_gating` (FlowSOM 68983 only: manual gating vs FlowKit and FlowJo, FlowSOM vs R) or `compensaid` (`cytiq spillqc` vs CompensAID on a raw `$SPILL` file through the vignette chain, and on `preprocessed.fcs` when present), or `classify` (`cytiq classify` with the cytiq-ml bundle in CYTIQ_CLASSIFY_BUNDLE on every file, against that model's native probabilities in CYTIQ_CLASSIFY_GOLDEN; skipped when either is unset). `instrument`, `source` and `license` record where downloaded files come from. Downloaded datasets are `optional`: skipped with a warning when the download fails. `slow` datasets run only with CYTIQ_REAL_SLOW=1.",
